    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8358" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπι-βούλευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without plots,</i>
			and so, <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>. 
				Act.
			, <i>not plotting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. πρὸς ἀλλήλους</span>”
				<i>the absence of intrigue,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.37
				</span></i>
			; <i>not insidious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2p.445S.
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>not plotted against, not liable to attack,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φθόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					1212
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				7.8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				9.59
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.645
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εάνθος.</span>
			</div>
